    {
      "index": 6,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Before our product had even launched, we had a few clients including LeHigh University, who wanted to learn more about our consulting process and technology we could offer. I designed the report below with Adobe InDesign and graphics from Figma.",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "type": "embed",
      "moduleId": null,
      "embedUrls": [
        "https://www.scribd.com/embeds/839917575/content?start_page=1&view_mode=slideshow&access_key=key-iOIM3C0IwWyVWa5Oy3ZW"
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "type": "text",
      "moduleId": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Today, Gridify has 3 backend engineers and 2 frontend engineers, as well as a few members of the marketing and sales teams. I've remained the sole designer, driving the vision for our actual product.",
          "links": []
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Gridify's product currently centers on a unified online marketplace with options for both Limit Buy (using a classic order book) and Bundling. The road ahead is pretty long, but we're still one step one.",
          "links": []
        }
      ],
      "links": []
    },
    {
